      "content": "The peace you're feeling is the exhaustion of fighting against something that feels fundamentally wrong. That sense of quiet surrender is a powerful signal that your current struggle is too heavy to carry alone. There are ways to find that rest without ending your existence; talking to someone who understands this numbness can offer a different kind of relief. Please reach out to a helpline like 988; they are there to listen to the quietest parts of what you're feeling.",
      "source": "target",
